# The public repository carries the plugin folder WITHOUT the compiled library.
# Binaries are attached to GitHub Releases and to itch.io, one archive per
# platform and per engine version. Nothing here is ever built from source: the
# source code is not published. See README.md.

# --- The plugin's own compiled libraries -----------------------------------
# They belong in a Release, not in git history. Delete these four lines if you
# ever decide to version them instead.
Steam.dll
Steam.so
Steam.dylib
libSteam.so
libSteam.dylib

# --- Valve's files. These must NEVER be committed anywhere. -----------------
# The Steamworks SDK is licensed to each developer personally and
# nontransferably. See NOTICE.md and Section 5 of LICENSE.txt.
steam_api*
libsteam_api*
sdkencryptedappticket*
steamclient*
tier0_s.*
vstdlib_s.*
redistributable_bin/
public/
sdk/

# --- Per-developer configuration. Never ours to publish. -------------------
steam_config.json
steam_appid.txt

# --- Debris ----------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdb
*.obj
*.o
*.exp
*.ilk
out/
build/
__pycache__/
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
